            ht: "Nan dokiman ou, tape fraz « Bonjou tout moun ». Chwazi l lè w glise sourit la, epi klike youn apre lòt sou onglè Accueil, Insertion ak Mise en page pou obsève bouton chak. Aplike gra a, epi peze Ctrl+Z pou anile.",
            en: "In your document, type the sentence \"Hello everyone\". Select it by dragging the mouse, then click in turn on the Home, Insert and Layout tabs to observe the buttons of each. Apply bold, then press Ctrl+Z to undo.",
